            "ja": "Sedov–Taylor点爆発：球対称の軽量検証",
            "en": "Sedov–Taylor point blast: lightweight spherical-radial validation"
          },
          "url": {
            "ja": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/validation/sedov-blast/?lang=ja",
            "en": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/validation/sedov-blast/?lang=en"
          },
          "availability": "run",
          "method_ids": [
            "rusanov",
            "heun"
          ],
          "note": {
            "ja": "球対称Euler方程式を半径方向の有限体積法で解く軽量例です。固定した半径0.03の領域に総エネルギー1を与え、128・256・512セルで点爆発の相似参照からの差と保存収支を測ります。図は1次元球対称データの断面表示で、2次元Cartesian計算ではありません。",
            "en": "A lightweight spherical-radial Euler finite-volume example deposits unit energy inside fixed radius0.03. Three grids of128/256/512 radial cells measure differences from a point-blast similarity reference and conservation budgets. The picture is a section display of1D spherical data, not a2D Cartesian calculation."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
